# --- Go build artifacts ---
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (uncomment if you vendor)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# --- Environment & secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Build output ---
bin/
dist/
build/

# --- IDE / Editor ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Project-specific (customize per project) ---
runs/
.enola/
# /tmp/
# /var/

# Local coding-agent workspace (worktrees, settings)
.claude/

# --- Customer workspaces never live in this repository (governance/CANVAS_UI_ACCEPTANCE.md, REVIEW I3) ---
# A customer workspace carries a STREAMSIM_CUSTOMER_WORKSPACE marker; test/architecture/canvas_test.go fails if one is here.
/workspaces/
